  "summary": "Recent preprints propose and demonstrate magnon-based routes to phase-controlled and entanglement-oriented microwave sources.",
  "synthesis": "The dominant thread is magnon-mediated nonlinear conversion of spin waves into microwave signals. arXiv:2611.25207 proposes tunable entangled propagating microwaves via three-magnon parametric down-conversion in thin ferromagnetic films. arXiv:2611.26932 demonstrates parametric excitation of nano-scale spin waves with two controlled phase states using a VCMA open-resonator transducer, with lowered threshold. arXiv:2611.21869 extends the magnon picture to optomechanics, reporting an attractive magnon-phonon interaction of -43 MHz in suspended CrSBr membranes. arXiv:2611.16721, on chiral high harmonic generation in NbP, is a distinct nonlinear optical topic. The novelty lies in phase-controlled and entanglement-oriented magnon sources with electrical control.",
  "synthesis_model": "claude-haiku-5-5",
  "synthesized_on": "2026-11-23"
}
